    "Ada": "Ada",
    "Ada and Leo each choose one secret bid for all three containers. They cannot see the other bid before both are submitted. A bid of $0 is allowed. Watch their bids reveal together.": "Ada和Leo各自為三個貨櫃選擇一個秘密出價。在雙方提交前無法看到對方的出價。允許出價$0。觀看他們的出價同時揭曉。",
    "Ada chooses you. You pay only your total bid of $10; the extra bid is not charged again. Leo pays nothing.": "Ada選擇你。你只需支付總出價$10；額外出價不會重複收費。Leo無需支付。",
    "Ada is auctioning two white containers and one tan container as a single shipment. Bid for all three, and remember she may keep them instead. You can ignore your value card for now: this chapter teaches bidding. The next chapters explain how containers score.": "Ada正在拍賣兩個白色貨櫃和一個米色貨櫃作為單一批貨物。為三個貨櫃出價，並記住她可能自己保留。你可以暫時忽略價值卡：本章教你出價。後續章節會解釋貨櫃如何計分。",
    "Ada offered $8; Leo offered $6. Accept Ada’s highest bid. She pays you $8 and gets all three containers on her island. The bank adds another $8: you receive $16 in total.": "Ada出價$8；Leo出價$6。接受Ada的最高出價。她支付你$8並將三個貨櫃放到她的島嶼上。銀行再加$8：你總共獲得$16。",
    "Ada pays her $6 bid and the bank matches it. How much cash do you receive in total?": "Ada支付她的$6出價，銀行配對相同金額。你總共會收到多少現金？",
    "Ada sails into your harbour and buys the white container for $4. Loading immediately after sailing into a harbour costs no extra action. A ship holds up to five containers. Watch the white container move from your warehouse onto her ship.": "Ada駛入你的港口，以$4購買白色貨櫃。駛入港口後立即裝載不需額外行動。一艘船最多可容納五個貨櫃。觀看白色貨櫃從你的倉庫移到她的船上。",
    "Add the $6 bid and the $6 bank subsidy.": "將$6出價與$6銀行補貼相加。",
    "Add white in the same action": "在同一行動中加入白色",
    "All five colours are present, so use the higher value on the card.": "五種顏色都齊全，因此使用卡片上較高的數值。",
