    "At final scoring, remove every container of your most numerous island colour. All containers of that colour score $0, regardless of their card value. If colours tie, remove your $5/10 colour if it is tied; otherwise the game removes the lowest-valued tied colour. Which colour must you remove here?": "最終計分時，移除你島嶼上數量最多顏色的所有貨櫃。該顏色的所有貨櫃計為$0，無論其卡片數值為何。若顏色平手，若你的$5/10顏色在平手之中則移除該顏色；否則遊戲移除平手中數值最低的顏色。你在此必須移除哪種顏色？",
