    "Click Ada’s white container in her factory sales, then your warehouse-sales square marked 3. You pay $2 and offer it for $3. You can now keep both the brown and white containers for visiting ships to buy. Buying a warehouse does not produce or include any containers.": "點擊Ada工廠出售區的白色貨櫃，然後點擊你倉庫出售區標記為3的格子。你支付$2並以$3出售。你現在可以保留棕色和白色貨櫃供來訪船隻購買。購買倉庫不會生產或包含任何貨櫃。",
    "Click Ada’s white container in her factory sales, then your warehouse-sales square marked 4. You pay her $2 and offer it for $4. The house-shaped row holds warehouse buildings. The squares below it hold containers for sale: their numbers are prices, not extra storage spaces. Your one warehouse holds one container.": "點擊Ada工廠出售區的白色貨櫃，然後點擊你倉庫出售區標記為4的格子。你支付她$2並以$4出售。房屋形狀的列放置倉庫建築。其下方的格子放置待售貨櫃：那些數字是價格，不是額外的儲存空間。你的一間倉庫可容納一個貨櫃。",
    "Click a white container in the supply, then your factory-sales square marked 3. This is still the same production action, with no extra $1 payment. More factories produce more stock; more warehouses let you buy and resell more stock from other players.": "點擊供應區的白色貨櫃，然後點擊你工廠出售區標記為3的格子。這仍是同一個生產行動，不需額外支付$1。更多工廠生產更多庫存；更多倉庫讓你能從其他玩家購買並轉售更多庫存。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the island harbour on the right and confirm the sailing move. Ada and Leo will bid for the entire cargo, just as in the previous auction.": "點擊你的藍色船隻，然後點擊右側的島嶼港口並確認航行移動。Ada和Leo將為整批貨物出價，就像之前的拍賣一樣。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the island harbour on the right to start the auction. Confirm the sailing move. An island auction ends your turn even if it was your first action. The seller does not submit a bid.": "點擊你的藍色船，然後點擊右側的島嶼港口以開始拍賣。確認航行移動。島嶼拍賣會結束你的回合，即使這是你的第一個行動。賣家不參與出價。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the open sea in the centre of the board. Moving directly from one harbour to another is not allowed. This uses one of your two actions.": "點擊你的藍色船，然後點擊棋盤中央的公海。不允許直接從一個港口移動到另一個港口。這會消耗你兩個行動中的一個。",
