    "The circles hold factories; the house shapes hold warehouses. Numbers in empty building slots are purchase costs. The squares BELOW each building row hold containers for sale. Their numbers are your selling prices. They do not tell you how many containers you can store.": "圓圈放置工廠；房屋形狀放置倉庫。空建築欄位中的數字是購買成本。每個建築列下方的方格放置待售貨櫃。這些數字是你的售價。它們不會告訴你可以儲存多少貨櫃。",
    "The last turn": "最後一回合",
    "The orange row says $5/10: each orange scores $10 if you have all five colours on your island, or $5 otherwise. Check this before removing any containers. You have all five colours. What is each orange worth?": "橘色列顯示 $5/10：如果你的島嶼擁有全部五種顏色，每個橘色得 $10，否則得 $5。在移除任何貨櫃之前先檢查。你擁有全部五種顏色。每個橘色價值多少？",
    "The subsidy rewards shipping": "補貼獎勵航運",
    "The three dark-green containers contribute $0. White earns $20, orange $10, tan $6 and brown $4: $40 from the island. Add $20 cash, $2 for your warehouse container and $3 for the container on your ship; subtract $11 for your loan. Factory stock and buildings score nothing. Choose Pass in the top-right corner to see the final result.": "三個深綠色貨櫃貢獻 $0。白色得 $20，橘色得 $10，米色得 $6，棕色得 $4：島嶼共 $40。加上 $20 現金、倉庫貨櫃 $2 和船上貨櫃 $3；減去貸款 $11。工廠庫存和建築物不計分。選擇右上角的跳過來查看最終結果。",
    "The two white containers are worth $20. The orange is worth $10 because it completes your five-colour set. Keeping adds $30 in containers, but costs $6 paid to the bank. What is the net gain?": "兩個白色貨櫃價值 $20。橘色價值 $10，因為它完成了你的五色套組。保留增加 $30 的貨櫃價值，但需支付 $6 給銀行。淨收益是多少？",
    "Tutorial": "教學",
    "Tutorial navigation": "教學導覽",
    "Two colours in the supply are empty, so the game ends after this turn. Your island has 3 dark green, 2 white, 1 orange, 1 tan and 1 brown. Each player has a private card with different values for these colours. Your card determines your final score; the prices you paid at auction do not.": "供應區中有兩種顏色已空，所以遊戲在本回合後結束。你的島嶼有 3 個深綠色、2 個白色、1 個橘色、1 個米色和 1 個棕色。每位玩家都有一張私人卡片，上面有這些顏色的不同價值。你的卡片決定你的最終分數；你在拍賣中支付的價格不影響。",
    "Undo": "復原",
    "Undo last move": "復原上一步",
    "Unknown Container chapter": "未知的 Container 章節",
    "Unpaid loans": "未償還貸款",
    "Upkeep": "維持費",
    "Use the board’s calculator: press 8, then Bid. Your offer is hidden from Leo until he has also bid. You only pay if Ada ultimately sells the cargo to you. You cannot bid more cash than you hold.": "使用圖板上的計算機：按 8，然後按 Bid。你的出價在 Leo 也出價前不會讓他看到。只有當 Ada 最後把貨賣給你時，你才需要付款。你的出價不能超過你持有的現金。",
    "Use the new storage space": "使用新的儲存空間",
    "Viewer mount point not found:": "找不到檢視器掛載點：",
    "Viewer mount point not found: {p0}": "找不到檢視器掛載點：{p0}",
    "WAREHOUSE SALES": "倉庫銷售",
    "Wait for both sealed bids before deciding what to do with your shipment.": "在決定如何處理你的貨物前，等待雙方秘密出價。",
    "Wait for the other bidder": "等待另一位出價者",
    "Waiting for": "等待中",
    "Waiting for {p0} to play...": "等待 {p0} 進行……",
    "Warehouse": "倉庫",
    "Warehouse Slot": "倉庫欄位",
    "Warehouse selling price": "倉庫售價",
    "Warehouse stock": "倉庫存貨",
    "Watch Ada choose": "觀看 Ada 選擇",
    "Watch Ada choose your offer": "觀看 Ada 選擇你的出價",
    "Watch Ada load her ship": "觀看 Ada 裝載她的船",
    "Watch Ada trade": "觀看 Ada 交易",
    "Watch the sealed bids": "觀看秘密出價",
    "What actually scores?": "實際上哪些會計分？",
    "What does keeping add?": "保留會增加什麼？",
    "What does selling earn?": "賣出能賺多少？",
    "Which entire colour is removed?": "哪一種顏色會整個移除？",
    "White containers": "白色貨櫃",
    "Wrong argument for the command": "指令的參數錯誤",
    "Wrong argument for the command {p0}": "指令 {p0} 的參數錯誤",
    "You": "你",
    "You already have three dark-green containers, one tan and one brown on your island. The ship’s white and orange containers would complete your five-colour set. This time, practise buying your own shipment.": "你的島上已經有三個深綠色貨櫃、一個米色和一個棕色貨櫃。船上的白色和橘色貨櫃會完成你的五色套組。這次，練習買下你自己的貨物。",
    "You and Leo both offered $8. Only the tied highest bidders bid again. Use the board’s calculator to bid 2 more, then confirm the $10 total. Your new total is $10, not $2. You may add $0, but cannot lower your first bid.": "你和 Leo 都出價 $8。只有並列最高出價者需要再次出價。使用圖板上的計算機再加 2，然後確認總額 $10。你的新總額是 $10，不是 $2。你可以加 $0，但不能降低第一次的出價。",
    "You are not allowed to run the command": "你不允許執行此指令",
    "You are not allowed to run the command {p0}": "你不允許執行指令 {p0}",
    "You bought a warehouse, then stock for it. Choose Pass in the top-right corner. Ada and Leo will pass so you can try expanding your factory next.": "你買了一間倉庫，然後為它進貨。選擇右上角的跳過。Ada 和 Leo 會跳過，讓你可以接著嘗試擴建你的工廠。",
    "You expanded both businesses": "你擴建了兩項事業",
    "You finish with $54": "你以 $54 結束",
    "You have $10 cash and three island containers. Ada received $20 including the subsidy. At the end of the game, every container of your most numerous island colour is removed. For example, with five white containers and four of each other colour, all five white containers are removed and score $0. The next chapters explain the rest of scoring.": "你有 $10 現金和三個島上貨櫃。Ada 收到 $20，包括補貼。遊戲結束時，你島上數量最多的那一種顏色的全部貨櫃都會被移除。例如，有五個白色貨櫃而其他顏色各四個，則五個白色貨櫃全部移除，計 $0。接下來的章節會說明其餘的計分方式。",
    "You have $14 left and all five colours on your island. Each orange now qualifies for $10. At final scoring, remove all three dark-green containers: they are your most numerous colour and score $0. To keep a shipment, you must be able to pay the highest bid. Loans give you $10, cost $1 interest each turn and deduct $11 each from your final score if unpaid.": "你剩下 $14，島上有全部五種顏色。每個橘色現在符合 $10 的條件。最終計分時，移除所有三個深綠色貨櫃：它們是你數量最多的顏色，計 $0。要保留一批貨物，你必須能支付最高出價。貸款給你 $10，在你的每個回合開始時支付 $1 利息，若未償還則每筆從最終分數扣除 $11。",
    "You have 3 dark green, 2 white, and 1 of each other colour. Remove the colour with the most containers.": "你有 3 個深綠色、2 個白色，其他顏色各 1 個。移除數量最多的顏色。",
    "You have two factories and two warehouses, with $7 left. Your factories can make two colours and store four containers in total. Your warehouses hold two containers bought from other players. Building prices and container sale prices are separate.": "你有兩間工廠和兩間倉庫，剩下 $7。你的工廠可以製造兩種顏色，總共儲存四個貨櫃。你的倉庫容納兩個從其他玩家買來的貨櫃。建築價格和貨櫃售價是分開的。",
    "You now have $36. Ada paid $8, Leo paid nothing, and your empty ship stays at the island. The next player’s turn begins. The bank subsidy goes only to the seller when another player buys the cargo.": "你現在有 $36。Ada 付了 $8，Leo 沒付，你的空船留在島邊。下一位玩家的回合開始。銀行補貼只有在其他玩家購買貨物時才給賣家。",
    "You paid $2 and sold for $4: a $2 trading margin. After the $1 production cost, you have $21. Your orange container is still for sale. Ships must pass through open sea between harbours; reaching the island auctions the entire cargo.": "你付了 $2 並以 $4 賣出：$2 的交易利潤。扣除 $1 生產成本後，你有 $21。你的橘色貨櫃仍在出售中。船隻必須在港口之間通過開放海域；抵達島嶼會拍賣整批貨物。",
    "You win": "你贏了",
    "You won the cargo, not the game yet": "你贏得了貨物，但還沒贏得遊戲",
    "Your": "你的",
    "Your $8 is submitted. Watch Leo submit his sealed bid; both first-round offers are then revealed.": "你的 $8 已提交。觀看 Leo 提交他的秘密出價；接著會揭示雙方第一輪的出價。",
    "Your buildings and stock": "你的建築和存貨",
    "Your cash": "你的現金",
    "Your cash: $": "你的現金：$",
    "Your extra $2 is secret until Leo submits his addition. Watch the second reveal.": "你額外的 $2 在 Leo 提交加價前是保密的。觀看第二次揭示。",
    "Your final total": "你的最終總分",
    "Your final total is: $20 + $40 + $2 + $3 − $11 = $54. The highest final total wins. Aim for profitable trade and useful island cargo, while watching which colour will be discarded. The final-score table below shows every component.": "你的最終總分是：$20 + $40 + $2 + $3 − $11 = $54。最終總分最高者獲勝。目標是進行有利可圖的交易和取得有用的島上貨物，同時留意哪種顏色會被棄掉。下方的最終計分表顯示每個組成部分。",
    "Your final total: $": "你的最終總分：$",
    "Your first trade is complete": "你的第一筆交易完成了",
    "Your island": "你的島嶼",
    "Your orange factory can produce one orange container. Click an orange container in the supply, then your factory-sales square marked 2. Production costs $1, paid to the player before you, and uses your first action.": "你的橘色工廠可以生產一個橘色貨櫃。點擊供應區中的一個橘色貨櫃，然後點擊你工廠銷售區標示 2 的方格。生產花費 $1，付給你前一位玩家，並使用你的第一個行動。",
    "Your orange factory makes orange containers. Click a white factory in the supply, then your empty circular factory slot to buy it. You may own only one factory of each colour. Each factory also adds two spaces to your factory sales stock.": "你的橘色工廠製造橘色貨櫃。點擊供應區中的一間白色工廠，然後點擊你空的圓形工廠欄位來購買它。每種顏色的工廠你只能擁有一間。每間工廠也會為你的工廠銷售存貨增加兩個空間。",
    "Your own values, hidden from others": "你自己的數值，對其他人隱藏",
    "Your private value card": "你的秘密價值卡",
    "Your sale prices:": "你的售價：",
    "Your sale prices: {p0}": "你的售價：{p0}",
    "Your ship is already loaded at Ada’s harbour. Two white containers and one orange container will be sold together. You are the seller: everyone else bids, then you decide whether to sell or buy the cargo yourself.": "你的船已經在 Ada 的港口裝載完畢。兩個白色貨櫃和一個橘色貨櫃會一起出售。你是賣家：其他所有人出價，然後你決定要賣出還是自己買下貨物。",
    "Your warehouse is full with one brown container. Each warehouse holds one container. Click a warehouse in the supply, then your empty house-shaped building slot to buy it for $4 and increase capacity to two. Buying a building uses one action.": "你的倉庫已滿，有一個棕色貨櫃。每間倉庫容納一個貨櫃。點擊供應區中的一間倉庫，然後點擊你空的房屋形建築欄位，花 $4 購買並將容量增加到兩個。購買建築使用一個行動。",
